    <innernamespace refid="namespacedap">dap</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>DAP stdin reader — background thread parsing Content-Length-framed JSON. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Runs a dedicated thread that reads DAP messages from stdin following the Debug Adapter Protocol wire format (Content-Length header + JSON body). Parsed messages are queued into a thread-safe FIFO consumed by the main thread. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
